g about you to everyone I know.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter, it's just a freelance position. Nothing worth bragging about.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You might become a managing editor one day!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It will be a long way to go before I get to a position like that.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wait, so, does this mean your name is going to be on the masthead?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, Peter. That is the general consensus when you work for a magazine.", "id": 3, "time": "48500", "image": "engenn5le16ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le16ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 4, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, Sally, did you hear from Cambridge Life?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I did!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I believe that you're speaking to Cambridge Life's newest freelancer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, well. You're now Ms. Sally Davis, the freelance journalist then?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That'd be correct.<br><br>\n\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: When do you start? What will you do?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I might start as early as Thursday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's great. Sounds like you're going to have to put in a lot of hours.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. I'm going to be super nervous.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah but personally, I think it's pretty exciting. Now I can say I know someone who works for a magazine. I'll brag about you to everyone I know.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter, it's just a freelance position. Nothing worth bragging about.<br><br>\n\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You might become a managing editor one day!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It will be a long way to go before I get to a position like that.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wait, so, does this mean your name is going to be on the masthead?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, Peter. That is the general consensus when you work for a magazine.", "type": "p"}], "_data": [], "type": "text", "template_override": 1}]}]}